// The states the cases of scc/ start from, on top of esc_fix's three functions
// (own/type/fix/) or esc_ffix's (fresh/fix/).
//
//   esc_scx(i, s, d)       function i is in state s at depth d
//   esc_scy(lo, ch, mn)    the pass in progress has read down to depth lo and
//                          seen ch masks grow, and mn functions (numbered 0 to
//                          mn - 1) are waiting
//   esc_ffo(i)             esc_ffix with function i running at depth 0

